 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? It depends. Some people find them useful for things like managing guest list and keeping everyone on track, while others find they take care of the easy stuff so the venue doesn't. Then a planner could be worth it for someone to keep everything running smoothly. Most photographers won't work the day of. So planner helps with things like guests arriving, dinner, dance and morning. And it saves you from burning out halfway through. Then it worth trying talk her round first. If that doesn't work, maybe one day as guest you can see how you feel. I' here to help, whether you use a planner or not.",
